    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύλλεκτρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>partner of the bed,
			husband</i> or <i>wife</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1268
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.874
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Egypt</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἄνασσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
